%% Phase1 / post / MV3-G01i 创建投票并落消息
%% 机器真源: cses-client phase1.manifest.json；MessageService.publishVote；Helix vote_score.rs；Java /vote/createVote；Go post_update；Angular vote card
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as Angular UI
  participant Gate as MessageService / MessageV3ImGate
  participant Native as Tauri im_vote_create
  participant E as Helix Tick / vote_score
  participant Java as Java CSES
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant Go as Go IM Server
  participant PG as PostgreSQL
  participant WS as WS inbound
  participant Sink as EventSink im:__bus__
  participant Store as Angular message store
  participant View as Vote card component
  UI->>Gate: openCreateVote() / publishVote(dto)
  Gate->>Native: invoke im_vote_create
  Native->>E: Tick::Command(im_vote_create)
  E->>Java: Effect::Http POST /vote/createVote
  Java->>Go: 创建 VOTE post
  Go->>PG: post/channel/channel_member/channel_event
  Go-->>E: HTTP 2xx 不是投票卡渲染终态
  Go-->>WS: post_update(type=VOTE)
  WS->>E: Tick::Inbound(post_update)
  E->>DB: PersistAtomic(message/channel/cursor)
  DB-->>E: PortReply(PersistOk)
  E->>Sink: im:post:updated
  Sink->>Store: IpcEventService upsert VOTE
  Store->>View: props.vote signal 渲染投票卡
